Signing in now checks that a phone is asking, not a script.

A refused sign-in says why. Tags in the share sheet wear their colours. An import no longer stops at a row it skipped, and a link to your Unbent opens in the app instead of replacing it. Evernote code blocks import on their own lines. The account menu has Help and Support.

Share a web page and the page becomes the note, pictures and all; paste one and it keeps its headings, links and lists.

A share your plan has no room for is kept on the phone, and says why.
